{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120083443082-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120084737\"/><p>私家車意外後翻側。</p><p>大埔發生交通意外。今晨(20日)8時34分，一輛私家車沿吐露港公路往上水方向行駛，至近康樂園對開時，失控撞向路旁石壆後向左翻側，橫亘行車線上，司機自行報案求助。救援人員接報到場前，司機已自行爬出車外。受事件影響往上水方向交通受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:04:01.557175+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:34:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:37:27.185626+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:57:32.978976+00:00","content_hash":"1e4e7248f826d2f263d508b77092e7feae7615d7e726535162c328b4b6c7d236","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}